<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<I>Private Placement Shares</I>&#148; means the shares of our Common Stock included in the Private Placement Units issued to the Initial
Stockholders in a private placement that closed prior to the IPO. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<I>Private Placement Units</I>&#148; means the units, consisting
