<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<I>Sponsor</I>&#148; means GigAcquisitions4, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company. </P>
