<TD VALIGN="top"><B>Shares of our Common Stock outstanding</B></TD>
<TD VALIGN="bottom">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="top">126,945,723 shares (as of December&nbsp;27, 2022).</TD></TR>
